      "id": 5003,
      "options": {
        "content": "**Every request already carries its actor and tenant attribution**: `user`, `group`, `virtual_key`, `jwt.org_id`/`jwt.team_id`, plus HTTP method/path/status. Org/team attribution is populated by usecases such as `multi-org-jwt-routing` (projects `x-gw-org-id`/`x-gw-team-id` headers) and `tiered-cost-control` (org/team/user budget subjects). This row answers *who did what, as which tenant, and was it let through*.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "",
      "type": "text"
    },
