      "id": 5021,
      "options": {
        "content": "**Tool deny-listing, tool-description sanitization, and PII masking on MCP tool calls are enforced today** - see the `extmcp-tool-deny`, `extmcp-tool-poisoning`, and `extmcp-pii-masking` usecases (also packaged as the `mcp-guardrails` walkthrough). Each guardrail decision is made by the ext-mcp-guardrail processor, and each processor call already appears as a trace span (method and target, but not yet the decision itself). **Per-decision audit panels will land here once the processor emits a structured decision log** alongside its existing enforcement - that is a small follow-up to the processor itself, not a gap in agentgateway.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "",
